n\n## Artifacts\n\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-promotion-gate.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-accepted-layer.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-provisional-safe-layer.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-review-required-layer.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-rejected-layer.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-blocked-quarantined-layer.v1.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-promotion-gate.validator-result.json`\n- `artifacts/method-map/v1-9709/semantic-kg-promotion-gate.readback.md`\n\n## Counts\n\n- Represented rows: 3530\n- Raw candidate assertions: 3\n- Accepted assertions: 0\n- Provisional safe assertions: 0\n- Review required assertions: 3\n- Rejected assertions: 0\n- Blocked/quarantined entries: 3527\n- Layer entries: 3530\n- External model calls: 0\n\n## Validation\n\n- `node scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-promotion-gate.mjs --write` -> pass; validator status pass; counts above.\n- `npm test -- --runInBand --runTestsByPath scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-promotion-gate.test.js` -> pass; 9 tests passed.\n- `npm run workflow:codex-preflight -- --json` -> warning only for branch naming/ahead/dirty state during final fix; report/artifact guard healthy; A+ ratchet healthy.\n- `ESLINT_USE_FLAT_CONFIG=true npx eslint scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-promotion-gate.mjs scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-promotion-gate.test.js` -> pass.\n- `node --check scripts/method-map/build-semantic-kg-promotion-gate.mjs && node --check scripts/method-map/__tests__/semantic-kg-promotion-gate.test.js` -> pass.\n- `git diff --check` -> pass.\n- GitHub CI -> all required checks green.\n- Gemini inline review threads -> 10/10 replied and resolved.\n\n## Boundaries\n\n- External model/API calls: 0.\n- No Supabase mutation.\n- No frontend UI.\n- No production RAG reindex.\n- No prerequisite graph, misconception layer, mastery layer, query/RAG surface, dashboard/readiness, or final closeout work included.\n\n## Blockers\n\nNone.\n","created_at":"2026-07-06T03:45:57Z","updated_at":"2026-07-06T03:56:21Z","closed_at":"2026-07-06T03:56:21Z","merged_at":"2026-07-06T03:56:21Z","merge_commit_sha":"b836b49cec188d5f88fcbae978bfb25390e9cf3f","assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"labels":[],"milestone":null,"draft":false,"commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1353/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/1353/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/issues/1353/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/Samsen879/ciecopilot-home/statuses/45d388ab52f8d3c5ccd0d7b01193918ca8b46256","head":{"label":"Samsen879:feat/issue-1326","ref":"feat/issue-1326","sha":"45d388ab52f8d3c5ccd0d7b01193918ca8b46256","user":{"login":"Samsen879","id":172257175,"node_id":"U_kgDOCkRvlw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/172257175?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879","html_url":"https://github.com/Samsen879","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Samsen879/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"repo":{"id":999357095,"nod